PsiLinux: doomgeneric e257a09 for the Psion (ports/build-doom.sh, -DPSILINUX): a 3 MB zone
by default, no 32-bit copy of the screen (i_psilinux.c draws into /dev/fb0),
TryRunTics sleeps until the next tic instead of 1 ms at a time and lets the
game keep time down to 5 frames a second, the column and span drawers made
fast on an ARM710T (r_draw.c: globals in locals, no AND for the texture row,
four pixels a turn), the settings kept (default.cfg and the saved games
beside Doom, which doomgeneric left out), and -playdemo fixed (its demo's
name outlived D_DoomMain).

